OL,3,GNEWSANI goods exports grew in 2025,
OL,4,Aofficial figures suggest
OL,5,
OL,6,FNorthern Ireland businesses increased
OL,7,Fthe value of sales and exports in their
OL,8,Fmajor markets in 2025, official figures
OL,9,Fsuggest.
OL,11,FThe data is not adjusted for the impact
OL,12,Fof inflation meaning that some of the
OL,13,Fincrease may reflect higher prices
OL,14,Frather than more products being sold.
OL,16,FSales to Great Britain, Northern
OL,17,FIreland's biggest external market, rose
OL,18,Fin value by 6.3% to #22.3bn. Sales to
OL,19,Fthe Republic of Ireland, the biggest
OL,20,Fexport destination, were up in value by
OL,21,F5.1% to #10.3bn.
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
